  "idea": "How to automate your phone to mute during meetings and bedtime",
  "text": "Built-in smartphone automation can silence notifications based on your exact work and sleep schedule. Constant evening pings from Slack and email ruin your downtime and disrupt healthy sleep patterns. Manually toggling do-not-disturb every single night is a tedious habit that people consistently forget. Configure an automated Sleep Focus on iOS or Bedtime Routine on Android for ten tonight. You protect your rest without touching a single button.",
